# Documentation maintenance

When the user asks to commit, or when you have finished a structural change (engine, games, API, themes, assets, stack):

1. Follow [project_docs/DOCUMENTATION_MAINTENANCE.md](mdc:project_docs/DOCUMENTATION_MAINTENANCE.md).
2. Start from [CONTEXT.md](mdc:CONTEXT.md); fix links/stack/folders if stale.
3. Edit the **canonical** deep doc for the touched area — do not add a new parallel architecture essay.
4. Add recurring pitfalls to [project_docs/lessons-learned.md](mdc:project_docs/lessons-learned.md).
5. Never reintroduce Taskmaster, Jest, `@pixi/react`, or Phaser planning docs.
